              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imana iravuga, it’ Amazi yo musi y’ijuru n’akoranire hamwe, i musozi na ho ni haboneke: biba kuno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ i musozi Imana ihita Isi, ikoraniro ry’amazi na ryo iryita Ibiyaga: Imana ibona kw ari vyiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.104.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 104:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imana iravuga, it’ Isi n’imere ivyatsi, n’ibimera vyose vyama utubuto, n’ibiti vyama ivyamwa vyavyo ukw amoko yavyo ari, birimw’ imbuto zavyo, kw isi nyene: biba kuno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw isi imera ivyatsi n’ibimera vyose vyama utubuto ukw amoko yavyo ari, n’ibiti vyama ivyamwa birimw’ imbuto zavyo, ukw amoko yavyo ari: nukw Imana ibona kw ari vyiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buragoroba, buraca: uwo n’umusi ugira gatatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
