          "text": "Imana irema ibifi binini‐binini, n’ibifise ubugingo vyose bigendagenda, ivyasegenyutse mu mazi, nk’ukw amoko yavyo ari, n’ibiguruka vyose bifise ivyubi, ukw amoko yavyo ari: Imana ibona kw ari vyiza. ",
